NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc kind=type
  digest=b3:30721a30937a06333365220e13331294eabd7ca2c6df78cf823cd18ad80e8173 file=neo/internal/config/kvx.go range=15:35 lang=go exported=false byte_range=251:1094
  sig=type kvxDoc struct {\n	sections	map[string]map[string]string\n	order		[]string\n}
  doc=kvxDoc is a parsed sectioned key/value document in the Matrix .kvx\nconvention (mirrors tachyon/internal/config/kvx.go — copied rather than\nimported because that parser lives behind an internal/ boundary in a\ndifferent module).\n\nFormat (zero-dep, deterministic):\n\n	# comment\n	[section]\n	key = "string"            # double-quoted strings (per Matrix .mtx convention)\n	num = 50                  # bare ints / bools\n	list = ["shell", "git"]   # bracketed, comma-separated, quoted items\n	[section.sub]\n	ref = "${ENV_VAR}"        # ${ENV} interpolated from the process environment\n\nValues are stored as raw tokens; typed accessors parse on demand. Section\nnames are case-sensitive; keys are trimmed. Later duplicate keys win.
EDGES
  contains=matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc#order,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc#sections,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.boolOr,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.floatOr,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.has,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.intOr,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.list,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.str,matrix/neo/internal/config.kvxDoc.strOr
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/config/kvx.go

